rgets the MedComMessagingMessageHeader from the current message.<table class=\"obligation grid\"><tr><td style=\"font-size: 11px\"><b>Obligations</b></td><td style=\"font-size: 11px\"><b>Actor</b></td></tr><tr><td style=\"font-size: 11px\"><b>SHALL</b>:<a href=\"http://hl7.org/fhir/extensions/5.4.0/CodeSystem-obligation.html#obligation-in-narrative\" title=\"Obligation Codes: include in narrative\">in-narrative</a></td><td style=\"font-size: 11px\" class=\"unchangedStyle\"><a href=\"ActorDefinition-ProducerActor.html\">Producer of FHIR resources</a></td></tr></table></td></tr>#xD;\n<tr class=\"xhtRowBorder0 xhtRowEven\"><td style=\"background-image: url(tbl_bck13.png)\" class=\"hierarchy xhtCellBorder0 xhtCellNoWrap\"><img src=\"tbl_spacer.png\" alt=\"\" style=\"background-color: inherit\" class=\"hierarchy\"/><img src=\"tbl_vjoin.png\" alt=\"\" style=\"background-color: inherit\" class=\"hierarchy\"/><img src=\"icon_slice.png\" alt=\"\" style=\"background-color: white; background-color: inherit\" title=\"Slice Definition\" class=\"hierarchy\"/> <span style=\"position: absolute; width: 1px; height: 1px; padding: 0; margin: -1px; overflow: hidden; clip: rect(0, 0, 0, 0); white-space: nowrap; border: 0\" class=\"sr-only\">Provenance.</span><a href=\"StructureDefinition-medcom-messaging-provenance-definitions.html#Provenance.occurred[x]\" class=\"xhtPieceItalic\">Slices for occurred[x]</a><a name=\"Provenance.occurred_x_\"> </a></td><td style=\"\" class=\"hierarchy xhtCellBorder0\"><span style=\"padding-left: 3px; padding-right: 3px; color: white; background-color: #B60000\" title=\"This element must be supported\" class=\"xhtPieceItalic\">S</span><span style=\"position: absolute; width: 1px; height: 1px; padding: 0; margin: -1px; overflow: hidden; clip: rect(0, 0, 0, 0); white-space: nowrap; border: 0\" class=\"sr-only\"> This element must be supported. </span></td><td style=\"\" class=\"hierarchy xhtCellBorder0\"><span class=\"xhtPieceItalic\"/><span class=\"xhtPieceItalic\">1</span><span class=\"xhtPieceItalic\">..</span><span class=\"xhtPieceItalic xhtPieceDeEmphasized\">1</span></td><td style=\"\" class=\"hierarchy xhtCellBorder0\"><a href=\"http://hl7.org/fhir/R4/datatypes.html#dateTime\" class=\"xhtPieceItalic xhtPieceDeEmphasized\">dateTime</a></td><td style=\"\" class=\"hierarchy xhtCellBorder0\"><span class=\"xhtPieceItalic xhtPieceDeEmphasized\">When the activity occurred</span><br class=\"xhtPieceItalic\"/><span class=\"xhtPieceBold xhtPieceItalic\">Slice: </span><span class=\"xhtPieceItalic\">Unordered, Open by type:$this</span><br class=\"xhtPieceItalic\"/><span class=\"xhtPieceBold xhtPieceItalic\">Slicing Note: </span><span class=\"xhtPieceItalic\">The rules on this element (including its children) apply to all the slices, but are not repeated in them</span></td></tr>#xD;\n<tr class=\"xhtRowBorder0 xhtRowOdd\"><td style=\"background-image: url(tbl_bck124.png)\" class=\"hierarchy xhtCellBorder0 xhtCellNoWrap\"><img src=\"tbl_spacer.png\" alt=\"\" style=\"background-color: inherit\" class=\"hierarchy\"/><img src=\"tbl_vline.png\" alt=\"\" style=\"background-color: inherit\" class=\"hierarchy\"/><img src=\"tbl_vjoin_end_slicer.png\" alt=\"\" style=\"background-color: inherit\" class=\"hierarchy\"/><img src=\"icon_slice_item.png\" alt=\"\" style=\"background-color: #F7F7F7; background-color: inherit\" title=\"Slice Item\" class=\"hierarchy\"/> <span style=\"position: absolute; width: 1px; height: 1px; padding: 0; margin: -1px; overflow: hidden; clip: rect(0, 0, 0, 0); white-space: nowrap; border: 0\" class=\"sr-only\">Provenance.Slices for occurred[x].</span><a href=\"StructureDefinition-medcom-messaging-provenance-definitions.html#Provenance.occurred[x]:occurredDateTime\" title=\"Slice occurredDateTime\">occurred[x]:occurredDateTime</a><a name=\"Provenance.occurred_x_:occurredDateTime\"> </a></td><td style=\"\" class=\"hierarchy xhtCellBorder0\"><span style=\"padding-left: 3px; padding-right: 3px; color: white; backg