"> </a></td><td style=\"\" class=\"hierarchy xhtCellBorder0\"><span style=\"padding-left: 3px; padding-right: 3px; color: white; background-color: #B60000\" title=\"This element must be supported\">S</span><span style=\"position: absolute; width: 1px; height: 1px; padding: 0; margin: -1px; overflow: hidden; clip: rect(0, 0, 0, 0); white-space: nowrap; border: 0\" class=\"sr-only\"> This element must be supported. </span></td><td style=\"\" class=\"hierarchy xhtCellBorder0\"><span class=\"xhtPieceDeEmphasized\">1</span><span class=\"xhtPieceDeEmphasized\">..</span><span class=\"xhtPieceDeEmphasized\">1</span></td><td style=\"\" class=\"hierarchy xhtCellBorder0\"><a href=\"http://hl7.org/fhir/R4/datatypes.html#instant\" class=\"xhtPieceDeEmphasized\">instant</a></td><td style=\"\" class=\"hierarchy xhtCellBorder0\">A system readable date and time for when the message is sent.</td></tr>#xD;\n<tr class=\"xhtRowBorder0 xhtRowOdd\"><td style=\"background-image: url(tbl_bck11.png)\" class=\"hierarchy xhtCellBorder0 xhtCellNoWrap\"><img src=\"tbl_spacer.png\" alt=\"\" style=\"background-color: inherit\" class=\"hierarchy\"/><img src=\"tbl_vjoin.png\" alt=\"\" style=\"background-color: inherit\" class=\"hierarchy\"/><img src=\"icon_element.gif\" alt=\"\" style=\"background-color: #F7F7F7; background-color: inherit\" title=\"Element\" class=\"hierarchy\"/> <span style=\"position: absolute; width: 1px; height: 1px; padding: 0; margin: -1px; overflow: hidden; clip: rect(0, 0, 0, 0); white-space: nowrap; border: 0\" class=\"sr-only\">Provenance.</span><a href=\"StructureDefinition-medcom-messaging-provenance-definitions.html#Provenance.activity\" title=\"Activity that occurred and triggered the current or a previous message\">activity</a><a name=\"Provenance.activity\"> </a></td><td style=\"\" class=\"hierarchy xhtCellBorder0\"><span style=\"padding-left: 3px; padding-right: 3px; color: white; background-color: #B60000\" title=\"This element must be supported\">S</span><span style=\"position: absolute; width: 1px; height: 1px; padding: 0; margin: -1px; overflow: hidden; clip: rect(0, 0, 0, 0); white-space: nowrap; border: 0\" class=\"sr-only\"> This element must be supported. </span></td><td style=\"\" class=\"hierarchy xhtCellBorder0\">1..<span class=\"xhtPieceDeEmphasized\">1</span></td><td style=\"\" class=\"hierarchy xhtCellBorder0\"><a href=\"http://hl7.org/fhir/R4/datatypes.html#CodeableConcept\" class=\"xhtPieceDeEmphasized\">CodeableConcept</a></td><td style=\"\" class=\"hierarchy xhtCellBorder0\"><span class=\"xhtPieceDeEmphasized\">Activity that occurred</span><br class=\"binding\"/><span class=\"xhtPieceBold binding\">Binding: </span><a href=\"http://medcomfhir.dk/ig/terminology/2.0.1/ValueSet-medcom-messaging-activityCodes.html\" title=\"http://medcomfhir.dk/ig/terminology/ValueSet/medcom-messaging-activityCodes\" class=\"binding\">MedComMessagingActivityCodes</a><span class=\"binding\"> (</span><a href=\"http://hl7.org/fhir/R4/terminologies.html#required\" title=\"To be conformant, the concept in this element SHALL be from the specified value set.\" class=\"binding\">required</a><span class=\"binding\">)</span></td></tr>#xD;\n<tr class=\"xhtRowBorder0 xhtRowEven\"><td style=\"background-image: url(tbl_bck101.png)\" class=\"hierarchy xhtCellBorder0 xhtCellNoWrap\"><img src=\"tbl_spacer.png\" alt=\"\" style=\"background-color: inherit\" class=\"hierarchy\"/><img src=\"tbl_vline.png\" alt=\"\" style=\"background-color: inherit\" class=\"hierarchy\"/><img src=\"tbl_vjoin_end.png\" alt=\"\" style=\"background-color: inherit\" class=\"hierarchy\"/><img src=\"icon_element.gif\" alt=\"\" style=\"background-color: white; background-color: inherit\" title=\"Element\" class=\"hierarchy\"/> <span style=\"position: absolute; width: 1px; height: 1px; padding: 0; margin: -1px; overflow: hidden; clip: rect(0, 0, 0, 0); white-space: nowrap; border: 0\" class=\"sr-only\">Provenance.activity.</span><a href=\"StructureDefinition-medcom-messaging-provenance-definitions.html#Provenance.activity.coding\">coding</a><a name=\"Provenance.activity.coding\"> </a></td><td style=\"\" class=\"hierarchy xhtCellBorder0\"><span style=\"padding-left: 3px; padding-right: 3px; color: white; background-color: #B60000\" title=\"This element must be supported\">S</span><span style=\"position: absolute; width: 1px; height: 1px; padding: 0; margin: -1px; overflow: hidden; clip: rect(0, 0, 0, 0); white-space: nowrap; border: 0\" class=\"sr-only\"> This element must be supported. </span></td><td style=\"\" class=\"hierarchy xhtCellBorder0\">1..1</td><td style=\"\" class=\"hierarchy xhtCellBorder0\"><a href=\"http://hl7.org/fhir/R4/datatypes.html#Coding\" class=\"xhtPieceDeEmphasized\">Coding</a></td><td style=\"\" class=\"hierarchy xhtCellBorder0\"><span class=\"xhtPieceDeEmphasized\">Code defined by a terminology system</span></td></tr>#xD;\n<tr class=\"xhtRowBorder0 xhtRowOdd\"><td style=\"background-image: url(tbl_bck1010.png)\" class=\"hierarchy xhtCellBorder0 xhtCellNoWrap\"><img src=\"tbl_spacer.png\" alt=\"\" style=\"background-color: inherit\" class=\"hierarchy\"/><img src=\"tbl_vline.png\" alt=\"\" style=\"background-color: inherit\" class=\"hierarchy\"/><img src=\"tbl_blank.png\" alt=\"\" style=\"background-color: inherit\" class=\"hierarchy\"/><img src=\"tbl_vjoin.png\" alt=\"\" style=\"background-color: inherit\" class=\"hierarchy\"/><img src=\"icon_element.gif\" alt=\"\" style=\"background-color: #F7F7F7; background-color: inherit\" title=\"Element\" class=\"hierarchy\"/> <span style=\"position: absolute; width: 1px; height: 1px; padding: 0; margin: -1px; overflow: hidden; clip: rect(0, 0, 0, 0); white-space: nowrap; border: 0\" class=\"sr-only\">Provenance.activity.coding.</span><a href=\"StructureDefinition-medcom-messaging-provenance-definitions.html#Provenance.activity.coding.system\">system</a><a name=\"Provenance.activity.coding.system\"> </a></td><td style=\"\" class=\"hierarchy xhtCellBorder0\"><span style=\"padding-left: 3px; padding-right: 3px; color: white; background-color: #B60000\" title=\"This element must be supported\">S</span><span style=\"position: absolute; width: 1px; height: 1px; padding: 0; margin: -1px; overflow: hidden; clip: rect(0, 0, 0, 0); white-space: nowrap; border: 0\" class=\"sr-only\"> This element must be supported. </span></td><td style=\"\" class=\"hierarchy xhtCellBorder0\">1..<span class=\"xhtPieceDeEmphasized\">1</span></td><td style=\"\" class=\"hierarchy xhtCellBorder0\"><a href=\"http://hl7.org/fhir/R4/datatypes.html#uri\" class=\"xhtPieceDeEmphasized\">uri</a></td><td style=\"\" class=\"hierarchy xhtCellBorder0\"><span class=\"xhtPieceDeEmphasized\">Identity of the terminology system</span></td></tr>#xD;\n<tr class=\"xhtRowBorder0 xhtRowEven\"><td style=\"background-image: url(tbl_bck1000.png)\" class=\"hierarchy xhtCellBorder0 xhtCellNoWrap\"><img src=\"tbl_spacer.png\" alt=\"\" style=\"background-color: inherit\" class=\"hierarchy\"/><img src=\"tbl_vline.png\" alt=\"\" style=\"background-color: inherit\" class=\"hierarchy\"/><img src=\"tbl_blank.png\" alt=\"\" style=\"background-color: inherit\" class=\"hierarchy\"/><img src=\"tbl_vjoin_end.png\" alt=\"\" style=\"background-color: inherit\" class=\"hierarchy\"/><img src=\"icon_element.gif\" alt=\"\" style=\"background-color: white; background-color: inherit\" title=\"Element\" class=\"hierarchy\"/> <span style=\"position: absolute; width: 1px; height: 1px; padding: 0; margin: -1px; overflow: hidden; clip: rect(0, 0, 0, 0); white-space: nowrap; border: 0\" class=\"sr-only\">Provenance.activity.coding.</span><a href=\"StructureDefinition-medcom-messaging-provenance-definitions.html#Provenance.activity.coding.code\" title=\"The activity defined by the system\">code</a><a name=\"Provenance.activity.coding.code\"> </a></td><td style=\"\" class=\"hierarchy xhtCellBorder0\"><span style=\"padding-left: 3px; padding-right: 3px; color: white; background-color: #B60000\" title=\"This element has obligations and must be supported\">SO</span><span style=\"position: absolute; width: 1px; height: 1px; padding: 0; margin: -1px; overflow: hidden; clip: rect(0, 0, 0, 0); white-space: nowrap; border: 0\" class=\"sr-only\"> This element has obligations and must be supported. </span></td><td style=\"\" class=\"hierarchy xhtCellBorder0\">1..<span class=\"xhtPieceDeEmphasized\">1</span></td><td style=\"\" class=\"hierarchy xhtCellBorder0\"><a href=\"http://hl7.org/fhir/R4/datatypes.html#code\" class=\"xhtPieceDeEmphasized\">code</a></td><td style=\"\" class=\"hierarchy xhtCellBorder0\"><span class=\"xhtPieceDeEmphasized\">Symbol in syntax defined by the system</span><table class=\"obligation grid\"><tr><td style=\"font-size: 11px\"><b>Obligations</b></td><td style=\"font-size: 11px\"><b>Actor</b></td></tr><tr><td style=\"font-size: 11px\"><b>SHALL</b>:<a href=\"http://hl7.org/fhir/extensions/5.4.0/CodeSystem-obligation.html#obligation-in-narrative\" title=\"Obligation Codes: include in narrative\">in-narrative</a></td><td style=\"font-size: 11px\" class=\"unchangedStyle\"><a href=\"ActorDefinition-ProducerActor.html\">Producer of FHIR resources</a></td></tr></table></td></tr>#xD;\n<tr class=\"xhtRowBorder0 xhtRowOdd\"><td style=\"background-image: url(tbl_bck11.png)\" class=\"hierarchy xhtCellBorder0 xhtCellNoWrap\"><img src=\"tbl_spacer.png\" alt=\"\" style=\"background-color: inherit\" class=\"hierarchy\"/><img src=\"tbl_vjoin.png\" alt=\"\" style=\"background-color: inherit\" class=\"hierarchy\"/><img src=\"icon_element.gif\" alt=\"\" style=\"background-color: #F7F7F7; background-color: inherit\" title=\"Element\" class=\"hierarchy\"/> <span style=\"position: absolute; width: 1px; height: 1px; padding: 0; margin: -1px; overflow: hidden; clip: rect(0, 0, 0, 0); white-space: nowrap; border: 0\" class=\"sr-only\">Provenance.</span><a href=\"StructureDefinition-medcom-messaging-provenance-definitions.html#Provenance.agent\">agent</a><a name=\"Provenance.agent\"> </a></td><td style=\"\" class=\"hierarchy xhtCellBorder0\"><span style=\"padding-left: 3px; padding-right: 3px; color: white; background-color: #B60000\" title=\"This element must be supported\">S</span><span style=\"position: absolute; width: 1px; height: 1px; padding: 0; margin: -1px; overflow: hidden; clip: rect(0, 0, 0, 0); white-space: nowrap; border: 0\" class=\"sr-only\"> This element must be supported. </span></td><td style=\"\" class=\"hierarchy xhtCellBorder0\"><span class=\"xhtPieceDeEmphasized\">1</span><span class=\"xhtPieceDeEmphasized\">..</span><span class=\"xhtPieceDeEmphasized\">*</span></td><td style=\"\" class=\"hierarchy xhtCellBorder0\"><a href=\"http://hl7.org/fhir/R4/datatypes.html#BackboneElement\" class=\"xhtPieceDeEmphasized\">BackboneElement</a></td><td style=\"\" class=\"hierarchy xhtCellBorder0\">The actors involved in the activity taking place</td></tr>#xD;\n<tr class=\"xhtRowBorder0 xhtRowEven\"><td style=\"background-image: url(tbl_bck100.png)\" class=\"hierarchy xhtCellBorder0 xhtCellNoWrap\"><img src=\"tbl_spacer.png\" alt=\"\" style=\"background-color: inherit\" class=\"hierarchy\"/><img src=\"tbl_vline.png\" alt=\"\" style=\"background-color: inherit\" class=\"hierarchy\"/><img src=\"tbl_vjoin_end.png\" alt=\"\" style=\"background-color: inherit\" class=\"hierarchy\"/><img src=\"icon_reference.png\" alt=\"\" style=\"background-color: white; background-color: inherit\" title=\"Reference to another Resource\" class=\"hierarchy\"/> <span style=\"position: absolute; width: 1px; height: 1px; padding: 0; margin: -1px; overflow: hidden; clip: rect(0, 0, 0, 0); white-space: nowrap; border: 0\" class=\"sr-only\">Provenance.agent.</span><a href=\"StructureDefinition-medcom-messaging-provenance-definitions.html#Provenance.agent.who\" title=\"Shall contain the messaging organization performing the activity. This also apply to an internal transmission to another messaging organization within a given system.\">who</a><a name=\"Provenance.agent.who\"> </a></td><td style=\"\" class=\"hierarchy xhtCellBorder0\"><span style=\"padding-left: 3px; padding-right: 3px; color: white; background-color: #B60000\" title=\"This element has obligations and must be supported\">SO</span><span style=\"position: absolute; width: 1px; height: 1px; padding: 0; margin: -1px; overflow: hidden; clip: rect(0, 0, 0, 0); white-space: nowrap; border: 0\" class=\"sr-only\"> This element has obligations and must be supported. </span></td><td style=\"\" class=\"hierarchy xhtCellBorder0\"><span class=\"xhtPieceDeEmphasized\">1</span><span class=\"xhtPieceDeEmphasized\">..</span><span class=\"xhtPieceDeEmphasized\">1</span></td><td style=\"\" class=\"hierarchy xhtCellBorder0\"><a href=\"http://hl7.org/fhir/R4/references.html\">Reference</a>(<a href=\"StructureDefinition-medcom-messaging-organization.html\">MedComMessagingOrganization</a>)<a href=\"http://hl7.org/fhir/R4/valueset-resource-aggregation-mode.html\"> {</a><a href=\"http://hl7.org/fhir/R4/valueset-resource-aggregation-mode.html\" title=\"When the resource is in a Bundle, the resource the reference points to will be found in the same bundle as the resource that includes the reference.\">b</a><a href=\"http://hl7.org/fhir/R4/valueset-resource-aggregation-mode.html\">}</a></td><td style=\"\" class=\"hierarchy xhtCellBorder0\">A reference to the actor of the activity, which shall be a MedComMessagingOrganization. If more actors has been involved, the element must be sliced.<table class=\"obligation grid\"><tr><td style=\"font-size: 11px\"><b>Obligations</b></td><td style=\"font-size: 11px\"><b>Actor</b></td></tr><tr><td style=\"font-size: 11px\"><b>SHALL</b>:<a href=\"http://hl7.org/fhir/extensions/5.4.0/CodeSystem-obligation.html#obligation-in-narrative\" title=\"Obligation Codes: include in narrative\">in-narrative</a></td><td style=\"font-size: 11px\" class=\"unchangedStyle\"><a href=\"ActorDefinition-ProducerActor.html\">Producer of FHIR resources</a></td></tr></table></td></tr>#xD;\n<tr class=\"xhtRowBorder0 xhtRowOdd\"><td style=\"background-image: url(tbl_bck01.png)\" class=\"hierarchy xhtCellBorder0 xhtCellNoWrap\"><img src=\"tbl_spacer.png\" alt=\"\" style=\"background-color: inherit\" class=\"hierarchy\"/><img src=\"tbl_vjoin_end.png\" alt=\"\" style=\"background-color: inherit\" class=\"hierarchy\"/><img src=\"icon_element.gif\" alt=\"\" style=\"background-color: #F7F7F7; background-color: inherit\" title=\"Element\" class=\"hierarchy\"/> <span style=\"position: absolute; width: 1px; height: 1px; padding: 0; margin: -1px; overflow: hidden; clip: rect(0, 0, 0, 0); white-space: nowrap; border: 0\" class=\"sr-only\">Provenance.</span><a href=\"StructureDefinition-medcom-messaging-provenance-definitions.html#Provenance.entity\" title=\"Shall only be included if the current message is a response to a previous message.\">entity</a><a name=\"Provenance.entity\"> </a></td><td style=\"\" class=\"hierarchy xhtCellBorder0\"><span style=\"padding-left: 3px; padding-right: 3px; color: white; background-color: #B60000\" title=\"This element must be supported\">S</span><span style=\"position: absolute; width: 1px; height: 1px; padding: 0; margin: -1px; overflow: hidden; clip: rect(0, 0, 0, 0); white-space: nowrap; border: 0\" class=\"sr-only\"> This element must be supported. </span></td><td style=\"\" class=\"hierarchy xhtCellBorder0\"><span class=\"xhtPieceDeEmphasized\">0</span><span class=\"xhtPieceDeEmphasized\">..</span><span class=\"xhtPieceDeEmphasized\">*</span></td><td style=\"\" class=\"hierarchy xhtCellBorder0\"><a href=\"http://hl7.org/fhir/R4/datatypes.html#BackboneElement\" class=\"xhtPieceDeEmphasized\">BackboneElement</a></td><td style=\"\" class=\"hierarchy xhtCellBorder0\"><span class=\"xhtPieceDeEmphasized\">An entity used in this activity</span></td></tr>#xD;\n<tr class=\"xhtRowBorder0 xhtRowEven\"><td style=\"background-image: url(tbl_bck010.png)\" class=\"hierarchy xhtCellBorder0 xhtCellNoWrap\"><img src=\"tbl_spacer.png\" alt=\"\" style=\"background-color: inherit\" class=\"hierarchy\"/><img src=\"tbl_blank.png\" alt=\"\" style=\"background-color: inherit\" class=\"hierarchy\"/><img src=\"tbl_vjoin.png\" alt=\"\" style=\"background-color: inherit\" class=\"hierarchy\"/><img src=\"icon_element.gif\" alt=\"\" style=\"background-color: white; background-color: inherit\" title=\"Element\" class=\"hierarchy\"/> <span style=\"position: absolute; width: 1px; height: 1px; padding: 0; margin: -1px; overflow: hidden; clip: rect(0, 0, 0, 0); white-space: nowrap; border: 0\" class=\"sr-only\">Provenance.entity.</span><a href=\"StructureDefinition-medcom-messaging-provenance-definitions.html#Provenance.entity.role\">role</a><a name=\"Provenance.entity.role\"> </a></td><td style=\"\" class=\"hierarchy xhtCellBorder0\"><span style=\"padding-left: 3px; padding-right: 3px; color: white; background-color: #B60000\" title=\"This element has obligations and must be supported\">SO</span><span style=\"position: absolute; width: 1px; height: 1px; padding: 0; margin: -1px; overflow: hidden; clip: rect(0, 0, 0, 0); white-space: nowrap; border: 0\" class=\"sr-only\"> This element has obligations and must be supported. </span></td><td style=\"\" class=\"hierarchy xhtCellBorder0\"><span class=\"xhtPieceDeEmphasized\">1</span><span class=\"xhtPieceDeEmphasized\">..</span><span class=\"xhtPieceDeEmphasized\">1</span></td><td style=\"\" class=\"hierarchy xhtCellBorder0\"><a href=\"http://hl7.org/fhir/R4/datatypes.html#code\" class=\"xhtPieceDeEmphasized\">code</a></td><td style=\"\" class=\"hierarchy xhtCellBorder0\"><span class=\"xhtPieceDeEmphasized\">derivation | revision | quotation | source | removal</span><table class=\"obligation grid\"><tr><td style=\"font-size: 11px\"><b>Obligations</b></td><td style=\"font-size: 11px\"><b>Actor</b></td></tr><tr><td style=\"font-size: 11px\"><b>SHALL</b>:<a href=\"http://hl7.org/fhir/extensions/5.4.0/CodeSystem-obligation.html#obligation-in-narrative\" title=\"Obligation Codes: include in narrative\">in-narrative</a></td><td style=\"font-size: 11px\" class=\"unchangedStyle\"><a href=\"ActorDefinition-ProducerActor.html\">Producer of FHIR resources</a></td></tr></table></td></tr>#xD;\n<tr class=\"xhtRowBorder0 xhtRowOdd\"><td style=\"background-image: url(tbl_bck001.png)\" class=\"hierarchy xhtCellBorder0 xhtCellNoWrap\"><img src=\"tbl_spacer.png\" alt=\"\" style=\"background-color: inherit\" class=\"hierarchy\"/><img src=\"tbl_blank.png\" alt=\"\" style=\"background-color: inherit\" class=\"hierarchy\"/><img src=\"tbl_vjoin_end.png\" alt=\"\" style=\"background-color: inherit\" class=\"hierarchy\"/><img src=\"icon_element.gif\" alt=\"\" style=\"background-color: #F7F7F7; background-color: inherit\" title=\"Element\" class=\"hierarchy\"/> <span style=\"position: absolute; width: 1px; height: 1px; padding: 0; margin: -1px; overflow: hidden; clip: rect(0, 0, 0, 0); white-space: nowrap; border: 0\" class=\"sr-only\">Provenance.entity.</span><a href=\"StructureDefinition-medcom-messaging-provenance-definitions.html#Provenance.entity.what\">what</a><a name=\"Provenance.entity.what\"> </a></td><td style=\"\" class=\"hierarchy xhtCellBorder0\"><span style=\"padding-left: 3px; padding-right: 3px; color: white; background-color: #B60000\" title=\"This element must be supported\">S</span><span style=\"position: absolute; width: 1px; height: 1px; padding: 0; margin: -1px; overflow: hidden; clip: rect(0, 0, 0, 0); white-space: nowrap; border: 0\" class=\"sr-only\"> This element must be supported. </span></td><td style=\"\" class=\"hierarchy xhtCellBorder0\"><span class=\"xhtPieceDeEmphasized\">1</span><span class=\"xhtPieceDeEmphasized\">..</span><span class=\"xhtPieceDeEmphasized\">1</span></td><td style=\"\" class=\"hierarchy xhtCellBorder0\"><a href=\"http://hl7.org/fhir/R4/references.html\">Reference</a>(<a href=\"http://hl7.org/fhir/R4/resource.html\" class=\"xhtPieceDeEmphasized\">Resource</a>)</td><td style=\"\" class=\"hierarchy xhtCellBorder0\">A reference to the previous message. If the previous message is a FHIR message, the reference element must be used and if the previous message is an EDIFACT or OIOXML, the identifier element must be used.</td></tr>#xD;\n<tr class=\"xhtRowBorder0 xhtRowEven\"><td style=\"background-image: url(tbl_bck0010.png)\" class=\"hierarchy xhtCellBorder0 xhtCellNoWrap\"><img src=\"tbl_spacer.png\" alt=\"\" style=\"background-color: inherit\" class=\"hierarchy\"/><img src=\"tbl_blank.png\" alt=\"\" style=\"background-color: inherit\" class=\"hierarchy\"/><img src=\"tbl_blank.png\" alt=\"\" style=\"background-color: inherit\" class=\"hierarchy\"/><img src=\"tbl_vjoin.png\" alt=\"\" style=\"background-color: inherit\" class=\"hierarchy\"/><img src=\"icon_element.gif\" alt=\"\" style=\"background-color: white; background-color: inherit\" title=\"Element\" class=\"hierarchy\"/> <span style=\"position: absolute; width: 1px; height: 1px; padding: 0; margin: -1px; overflow: hidden; clip: rect(0, 0, 0, 0); white-space: nowrap; border: 0\" class=\"sr-only\">Provenance.entity.what.</span><a href=\"StructureDefinition-medcom-messaging-provenance-definitions.html#Provenance.entity.what.reference\" title=\"Shall contain the message header id of messages given as input to the activity\">reference</a><a name=\"Provenance.entity.what.reference\"> </a></td><td style=\"\" class=\"hierarchy xhtCellBorder0\"><span style=\"padding-left: 3px; padding-right: 3px; color: white; background-color: #B60000\" title=\"This element has obligations and must be supported\">SO</span><span style=\"position: absolute; width: 1px; height: 1px; padding: 0; margin: -1px; overflow: hidden; clip: rect(0, 0, 0, 0); white-space: nowrap; border: 0\" class=\"sr-only\"> This element has obligations and must be supported. </span></td><td style=\"\" class=\"hierarchy xhtCellBorder0\"><span class=\"xhtPieceDeEmphasized\">0</span><span class=\"xhtPieceDeEmphasized\">..</span><span class=\"xhtPieceDeEmphasized\">1</span></td><td style=\"\" class=\"hierarchy xhtCellBorder0\"><a href=\"http://hl7.org/fhir/R4/datatypes.html#string\" class=\"xhtPieceDeEmphasized\">string</a></td><td style=\"\" class=\"hierarchy xhtCellBorder0\">If the previous message is a FHIR message, this element must hold the MessageHeader.id from previous message, formatted as MessageHeader/[id].<table class=\"obligation grid\"><tr><td style=\"font-size: 11px\"><b>Obligations</b></td><td style=\"font-size: 11px\"><b>Actor</b></td></tr><tr><td style=\"font-size: 11px\"><b>SHALL</b>:<a href=\"http://hl7.org/fhir/extensions/5.4.0/CodeSystem-obligation.html#obligation-in-narrative\" title=\"Obligation Codes: include in narrative\">in-narrative</a></td><td style=\"font-size: 11px\" class=\"unchangedStyle\"><a href=\"ActorDefinition-ProducerActor.html\">Producer of FHIR resources</a></td></tr></table></td></tr>#xD;\n<tr class=\"xhtRowBorder0 xhtRowOdd\"><td style=\"background-image: url(tbl_bck0000.png)\" class=\"hierarchy xhtCellBorder0 xhtCellNoWrap\"><img src=\"tbl_spacer.png\" alt=\"\" style=\"background-color: inherit\" class=\"hierarchy\"/><img src=\"tbl_blank.png\" alt=\"\" style=\"background-color: inherit\" class=\"hierarchy\"/><img src=\"tbl_blank.png\" alt=\"\" style=\"background-color: inherit\" class=\"hierarchy\"/><img src=\"tbl_vjoin_end.png\" alt=\"\" style=\"background-color: inherit\" class=\"hierarchy\"/><img src=\"icon_element.gif\" alt=\"\" style=\"background-color: #F7F7F7; background-color: inherit\" title=\"Element\" class=\"hierarchy\"/> <span style=\"position: absolute; width: 1px; height: 1px; padding: 0; margin: -1px; overflow: hidden; clip: rect(0, 0, 0, 0); white-space: nowrap; border: 0\" class=\"sr-only\">Provenance.entity.what.</span><a href=\"StructureDefinition-medcom-messaging-provenance-definitions.html#Provenance.entity.what.identifier\" title=\"Shall contain the message header id of messages given as input to the activity if the previous message is not a fhir message\">identifier</a><a name=\"Provenance.entity.what.identifier\"> </a></td><td style=\"\" class=\"hierarchy xhtCellBorder0\"><span style=\"padding-left: 3px; padding-right: 3px; color: white; background-color: #B60000\" title=\"This element has obligations and must be supported\">SO</span><span style=\"position: absolute; width: 1px; height: 1px; padding: 0; margin: -1px; overflow: hidden; clip: rect(0, 0, 0, 0); white-space: nowrap; border: 0\" class=\"sr-only\"> This element has obligations and must be supported. </span></td><td style=\"\" class=\"hierarchy xhtCellBorder0\"><span class=\"xhtPieceDeEmphasized\">0</span><span class=\"xhtPieceDeEmphasized\">..</span><span class=\"xhtPieceDeEmphasized\">1</span></td><td style=\"\" class=\"hierarchy xhtCellBorder0\"><a href=\"http://hl7.org/fhir/R4/datatypes.html#Identifier\" class=\"xhtPieceDeEmphasized\">Identifier</a></td><td style=\"\" class=\"hierarchy xhtCellBorder0\">If previous message is EDIFACT or OIOXML, this element must be expressed as [lokationsnummer]#[brevid] from the EDIFACT or OIOXML message.<table class=\"obligation grid\"><tr><td style=\"font-size: 11px\"><b>Obligations</b></td><td style=\"font-size: 11px\"><b>Actor</b></td></tr><tr><td style=\"font-size: 11px\"><b>SHALL</b>:<a href=\"http://hl7.org/fhir/extensions/5.4.0/CodeSystem-obligation.html#obligation-in-narrative\" title=\"Obligation Codes: include in narrative\">in-narrative</a></td><td style=\"font-size: 11px\" class=\"unchangedStyle\"><a href=\"ActorDefinition-ProducerActor.html\">Producer of FHIR resources</a></td></tr></table></td></tr>#xD;\n<tr><td colspan=\"5\" class=\"hierarchy\"><br/><a href=\"https://build.fhir.org/ig/FHIR/ig-guidance/readingIgs.html#table-views\" title=\"Legend for this format\"><img src=\"data:image/png;base64,\" alt=\"doco\" style=\"background-color: inherit\"/> Documentation for this format</a></td></tr></table></div>"
